```twig
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>PIG</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background: #fff;
            color: #222;
        }

        /* Top bar */
        .topbar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            right: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            background: #fff;
        }

        /* Hamburger */
        .menu {
            position: relative;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .menu-icon {
            width: 22px;
            height: 2px;
            background: #222;
            display: block;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        /* Dropdown */
        .menu-dropdown {
            position: absolute;
            top: 30px;
            right: 0;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 10px 0;
            display: none;
            min-width: 120px;
        }

        .menu-dropdown a {
            display: block;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #333;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .menu-dropdown a:hover {
            background: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .menu.open .menu-dropdown {
            display: block;
        }

        /* Center content */
        .center {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 120px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ddd;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
    <div class="menu" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
        <span class="menu-icon"></span>
        <span class="menu-icon"></span>
        <span class="menu-icon"></span>

        <div class="menu-dropdown">
            <a href="{{ is_login ? url('user.logout') : url('user.login') }}">{{ is_login ? 'Logout' : 'Login' }}</a>

            {% if is_login %}
                <a href="{{ url('pig_farmer.admin_dashboard') }}">Panel</a>
            {% endif %}

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="center">
    <div class="logo">PIG</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
